[2026-01-30T17:09:50.908Z] [STDOUT] {"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_01Sa9sdadVjDsqi4VEqkDXyx","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Implementation Complete: Animation Is Data Visualization\n\n**Requirement**: `idea-9a55c22f-animation-is-data-visualizatio`\n\n### Created Files\n\n**`src/components/report/core/AnimatedValue.tsx`** - Universal animation primitive system:\n\n#### Core Components\n- **`AnimatedValue<T>`** - Universal primitive that wraps any changing value with configurable transition visualization\n  - Supports multiple transition styles: `instant`, `tween`, `crossfade`, `slide`, `morph`, `flash`, `pulse`, `scale`, `count`\n  - Direction detection for numeric values (increase/decrease)\n  - Theme-aware highlight colors\n  - Reduced motion support\n\n- **`AnimatedNumberEnhanced`** - Enhanced number animation with formatting\n  - Decimal places, prefix/suffix support\n  - Custom format functions\n  - Defaults to counting animation\n\n- **`AnimatedText`** - Text value animation with crossfade/slide transitions\n  - Smooth text swaps with AnimatePresence\n  - Configurable element tags\n\n- **`AnimatedList<T>`** - Staggered list entry/exit animations\n  - Directional animations (up/down/left/right)\n  - Configurable stagger delay\n  - Layout animations for reordering\n\n- **`AnimatedPresenceWrapper`** - Conditional rendering with enter/exit animations\n  - Multiple animation types: fade, scale, slide, slideUp, slideDown\n\n- **`AnimatedDiff`** - Animated difference display between two values\n  - Direction indicators (↑/↓)\n  - Positive/negative coloring\n\n- **`AnimatedScore`** - Score display with change tracking\n  - Size variants (sm/md/lg)\n  - Score-based coloring\n  - Optional change indicator\n\n#### Hooks\n- **`useValueTransition<T>`** - Manages animated transitions between values\n  - Custom interpolation support\n  - Direction detection\n  - Reduced motion awareness\n\n- **`useAnimationOnChange<T>`** - Tracks value changes and provides animation state\n  - Callbacks for animation start/end\n  - Direction tracking\n\n### Updated Files\n- **`src/components/report/core/index.tsx`** - Added AnimatedValue exports\n\n### Key Benefits\n1. **Systematic approach** - All data displays can now animate on change\n2. **Cognitive purpose** - Animation directs attention to what changed\n3. **Configurable** - Multiple transition styles for different use cases\n4. **Type-safe** - Generic components work with any data type\n5. **Reduced motion** - Full accessibility support\n6. **Theme-aware** - Respects swiss/radar themes"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":306,"cache_read_input_tokens":55696,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":306},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"bb700aba-f9fc-4283-93cf-561e37220b63","uuid":"e98ba2a3-53f8-4514-9d14-79d413e38deb"}
